  ('t-2', 'Priya Varghese', 'Sciatic Spine Pain', 'Kativasti & Herbal Oils', '4 Weeks', 'Authentic warm oil pooling therapies at the Kerala Zen center relieved my intense back and leg stiffness. I am pain-free and walking comfortably.', 5, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=150&q=80'),
