  ('dis-22', 'Depression', 'depression', 'Major Depressive Disorder', '[\"Vishada\",\"Manas Mandata\"]', 'Mental Wellness', 'Psychological Imbalances', 'A persistent feeling of sadness and loss of interest, classified as Vishada in Ayurveda, caused by Kapha-Vata mental stagnation.', 'In Ayurveda, Depression is analyzed as Vishada or Manas Mandata (sluggish mental energy). It involves an accumulation of Kapha and Vata doshas in the mind channels (Manovaha Srotas), depleting mental strength (Sattva) and lowering neurotransmitter Agni.', '[\"Severe emotional loss or trauma\",\"Chronic stress and physical exhaustion\",\"Improper diet lacking fresh Prana\",\"Genetics\"]', '[\"Persistent low mood and sadness\",\"Loss of interest in all activities\",\"Lack of energy and constant lethargy\",\"Feelings of worthlessness or guilt\",\"Changes in appetite/sleep\"]', '[\"Social withdrawal\",\"Mild fatigue\",\"Slight sleep changes\"]', '[\"Severe suicidal thoughts\",\"Complete neglect of self-care\",\"Catatonic states\"]', '[\"Family history\",\"Trauma\",\"Chronic medical conditions\",\"Lack of social support\"]', '[\"Suicidal behavior\",\"Self-harm\",\"Chronic physical illnesses\"]', '[\"Follow a fresh Sattvik diet\",\"Engage in social interactions\",\"Exercise daily in sunlight\"]', '[\"Drink warm saffron milk\",\"Consume fresh amla daily\"]', 'Sattvavajaya Chikitsa (psychotherapy), mind-tonic herbs (Medhya Rasayana), and head treatments like Shirodhara to restore brain Agni.', 'Psychotherapy (CBT), antidepressant medications, and lifestyle support.', '[\"Brahmi\",\"Shankhpushpi\",\"Ashwagandha\",\"Jatamansi\"]', '[\"Saraswatarishta\",\"Manasamitra Vatakam\",\"Brahmi Gritha\"]', '[\"Fresh sweet fruits\",\"Cow\'s Ghee\",\"Saffron and cardamom milk\",\"Almonds\",\"Mung dal\"]', '[\"Leftover stale foods\",\"Alcohol and recreational drugs\",\"Processed canned items\",\"Excessive cold/heavy foods\"]', '[\"Surya Namaskar\",\"Bhramari Pranayama\",\"Dhanurasana\"]', '[\"Cardio exercise in nature (brisk walking/jogging) 30 mins\"]', 'Wake up by 6 AM, walk in early morning sunlight, maintain a positive gratitude journal, and sleep early.', '7-8 hours; avoid oversleeping in the day which worsens Kapha depression.', 'Mindfulness and yoga therapy.', '[\"Kapha\",\"Vata\"]', '[\"Nervous System\",\"Brain\",\"Mind (Manovaha Srotas)\"]', 'All', 'All', 1, 0, 'High', 'Varies by individual (typically 3-6 months for psychological recovery)', 'If low mood persists for more than 2 weeks, or if thoughts of self-harm arise.', 'Expressions of suicide, extreme hopelessness, or severe self-neglect.', 84, '[{\"answer\":\"Shirodhara relaxes the brain, triggers the release of serotonin and endorphins, and calms the mental wind (Vata), helping lift the mood.\",\"question\":\"How does Shirodhara help in depression?\"}]', '[\"Charaka Samhita Sutra Sthana\",\"American Psychiatric Association DSM-5\"]', 'Psychiatrist', '[\"anxiety\",\"insomnia\"]', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540555700478-4be289fbecef?w=500&q=80', '[\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540555700478-4be289fbecef?w=500&q=80\"]', '[]', '4.70', 450, 130, '2026-10-02 07:04:36', '2026-10-02 07:04:36'),
  ('dis-23', 'Acid Reflux', 'acid-reflux', 'GERD', '[\"Amlapitta variant\",\"Urdhwaga Amlapitta\"]', 'Digestive Disorders', 'Gastrointestinal Imbalances', 'Acid backup from the stomach into the esophagus, causing heartburn, understood as Urdhwaga Amlapitta.', 'In Ayurveda, GERD/Acid Reflux is called Urdhwaga Amlapitta (upward acid fire). It occurs when aggravated Pitta dosha weakens the digestive valve, allowing acidic digestive contents to travel upwards, irritating the esophagus.', '[\"Highly acidic, fermented, and spicy food\",\"Sleeping immediately after heavy meals\",\"High stress and anxiety levels\",\"Obesity\"]', '[\"Heartburn (burning sensation in chest)\",\"Sour taste in mouth\",\"Regurgitation of food/acid\",\"Bloating and throat irritation\"]', '[\"Mild burning in stomach\",\"Frequent belching\"]', '[\"Difficulty swallowing (Dysphagia)\",\"Chronic dry cough\",\"Chest pain\"]', '[\"Obesity\",\"Pregnancy\",\"Late night eating\",\"Smoking\"]', '[\"Esophageal stricture\",\"Barrett\'s Esophagus (pre-cancerous changes)\"]', '[\"Eat dinner 3 hours before bed\",\"Limit acidic/spicy foods\",\"Avoid tight clothing around abdomen\"]', '[\"Chew fennel seeds after meals\",\"Drink cold aloe vera juice daily\"]', 'Cooling Pitta-pacifying herbs, Virechana to expel excess bile, and lifestyle modification to regulate Agni.', 'Proton Pump Inhibitors (PPIs), antacids, and lifestyle modifications.', '[\"Amalaki\",\"Yashtimadhu\",\"Shatavari\",\"Aloe Vera\"]', '[\"Avipattikar Churna\",\"Kamdudha Ras\",\"Sootashekhar Ras\"]', '[\"Coconut water\",\"Sweet pomegranates\",\"Oatmeal\",\"Fennel water\",\"Ripe melons\"]', '[\"Tomatoes and citrus\",\"Vinegar and pickles\",\"Caffeine and chocolates\",\"Spicy green chillies\",\"Sour curd\"]', '[\"Vajrasana (after meals)\",\"Sheetali Pranayama\",\"Shavasana\"]', '[\"Light evening walks\"]', 'Maintain upright posture for 2 hours after meals, eat light and dry dinners, and drink cooling liquids.', '7-8 hours; sleep with head elevated by 6 