  ('doc-dir-1', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Aditya Vardhan Sharma', 'dradityavardhansharma0@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Panchakarma Specialist', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Panchakarma)', 18, '4.80', 124, 800, 800, 600, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Rajasthani\"]', 'Shri Dhanwantari Panchakarma & Wellness Center', 'Jaipur', 'India', 'Dr. Aditya Vardhan Sharma is a distinguished Panchakarma expert with over 18 years of clinical practice focusing on chronic metabolic and musculoskeletal disorders. He utilizes a meticulous Nadi Pariksha diagnostic approach to customize intensive detoxification therapies like Virechana and Basti for his patients. His practice integrates classical Shirodhara techniques with evidence-based herbal protocols to ensure holistic restoration of the Tridosha balance.', '[\"B.A.M.S - National Institute of Ayurveda (NIA), Jaipur\",\"M.D (Panchakarma) - National Institute of Ayurveda (NIA), Jaipur\"]', '[\"Rajasthan State Ayush Gaurav Samman 2019\",\"Excellence in Panchakarma Therapy Award 2022\"]', '[\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Virechana & Basti Karma\",\"Chronic Pain Management\"]', 'Mon - Sat (9:00 AM - 1:00 PM, 4:00 PM - 7:00 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-10', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Sandeep Kulkarni', 'drsandeepkulkarni9@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Kayachikitsa (General Medicine)', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 19, '4.90', 156, 1200, 1200, 900, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Marathi\"]', 'Shree Dhanwantari Ayurvedic Clinic & Research Centre', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'Dr. Sandeep Kulkarni is a seasoned Kayachikitsa specialist with nearly two decades of experience in managing chronic lifestyle disorders through traditional Shodhana and Shamana therapies. He integrates classical Nadi Pariksha with modern diagnostic insights to provide personalized treatment protocols for metabolic and autoimmune conditions. His expertise lies in Agni management and the administration of specialized Rasayana procedures to restore systemic balance.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Podar Ayurved Medical College, Mumbai\",\"M.D (Kayachikitsa) - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Vaidya Ratna Award 2018\",\"Excellence in Kayachikitsa Practice 2022\"]', '[\"Pulse Diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha)\",\"Management of Metabolic Disorders\",\"Panchakarma and Rasayana Therapy\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 2280, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594824813573-246434de83fb?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-11', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Vikramaditya Singh', 'drvikramadityasingh10@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Shalya Tantra (Ayurvedic Surgery & Marma)', 'BAMS, MS (Ayurveda - Shalya Tantra)', 18, '4.80', 142, 1200, 1200, 900, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Punjabi\"]', 'Dhanwantari Shalya & Marma Chikitsa Kendra', 'Delhi', 'India', 'Dr. Vikramaditya Singh is a seasoned Shalya Tantra expert with nearly two decades of experience specializing in para-surgical procedures like Kshara Sutra and Agnikarma. He employs a rigorous diagnostic approach, integrating Marma Chikitsa with specialized herbal protocols to manage complex anorectal disorders and chronic pain. His practice is dedicated to providing minimally invasive Ayurvedic surgical solutions that focus on rapid recovery and long-term wellness.', '[\"B.A.M.S - National Institute of Ayurveda, Jaipur\",\"M.S (Shalya Tantra) - Banaras Hindu University (BHU), Varanasi\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Award for Surgical Excellence 2019\",\"Best Shalya Specialist in North India 2022\"]', '[\"Kshara Sutra Therapy for Anorectal Disorders\",\"Marma Therapy & Pain Management\",\"Agnikarma & Rakta Mokshana\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 94, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559839734-2b71ea197ec2?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-12', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Radhika Nair', 'drradhikanair11@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga (Gynaecology)', 'BAMS, MS (Ayurveda - Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga)', 14, '4.80', 112, 600, 600, 500, '[\"English\",\"Malayalam\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Hindi\"]', 'Kottakkal Arya Vaidya Sala Agency & Ayurvedic Clinic, Kochi', 'Kochi', 'India', 'Dr. Radhika Nair is a highly accomplished Ayurvedic gynaecologist with over 14 years of dedicated experience in managing complex female reproductive disorders. She utilizes classical Ashtasthana Pariksha (eight-fold diagnosis) and Nadi Pariksha to identify underlying dosha imbalances before creating personalized treatment regimes. Her clinical expertise lies in administering specialized therapies like Uttar Basti and Yoniprakshalana, alongside traditional herbal formulations, for successfully managing PCOD, uterine fibroids, and female infertility.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Government Ayurveda College, Tripunithura, Kochi\",\"M.S (Ayurveda) in Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Puraskar for Gynaecological Excellence 2022\",\"Kerala State Ayush Excellence Award 2020\"]', '[\"Uttar Basti (Intrauterine Therapy)\",\"Infertility & Garbhasanskar\",\"PCOD/PCOS Management\",\"Menopausal Syndrome Therapy\"]', 'Mon - Sat (9:30 AM - 1:30 PM, 4:30 PM - 7:30 PM)', 91, 1680, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-13', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. K. S. Venkatesh Murthy', 'drksvenkateshmurthy12@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Diabetes & Metabolic Disorders', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 22, '4.80', 142, 850, 850, 700, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Kannada\",\"Sanskrit\"]', 'Sri Sri Tattva Panchakarma Center, Bangalore', 'Bangalore', 'India', 'With over two decades of clinical practice, Dr. Murthy specializes in managing type 2 diabetes and metabolic syndrome through personalized Kayachikitsa protocols. He utilizes Nadi Pariksha for deep diagnostic insights, focusing on correcting the root cause of metabolic imbalances rather than just suppressing symptoms. His treatment plans integrate traditional Shodhana therapies like Virechana with specialized herbal formulations to naturally improve glucose metabolism and prevent diabetic complications.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Government Ayurvedic Medical College, Bangalore\",\"M.D - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Ayurveda Ratna Award 2018\",\"Excellence in Metabolic Health 2023\"]', '[\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Prameha (Diabetes) Management\",\"Panchakarma Detoxification\"]', 'Mon - Sat (9:00 AM - 1:00 PM, 4:00 PM - 7:30 PM)', 91, 2640, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-14', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Aniket Deshpande', 'draniketdeshpande13@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Arthritis & Spine Specialist', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.80', 142, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Marathi\",\"Sanskrit\"]', 'Sanjeevani Ayurvedic Spine & Joint Center', 'Pune', 'India', 'Dr. Deshpande is a renowned specialist with over 18 years of experience in managing chronic musculoskeletal disorders through traditional Ayurvedic protocols. He employs a rigorous Nadi Pariksha diagnostic approach to create personalized treatment plans focused on avoiding surgery for complex spinal conditions. His practice integrates specialized Panchakarma therapies like Kati Basti and Griva Basti with potent herbal formulations to ensure long-term joint health and mobility.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Tilak Ayurved Mahavidyalaya, Pune\",\"M.D - National Institute of Ayurveda (NIA), Jaipur\"]', '[\"Vaidya Ratna Award 2019\",\"Excellence in Ayurvedic Orthopedics 2023\"]', '[\"Marma Chikitsa (Pressure Point Therapy)\",\"Agnikarma (Thermal Micro-cautery)\",\"Kati Basti for Disc Prolapse\"]', 'Mon - Sat (9:30 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594824813573-246434de83fb?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-15', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Anand Vardhan Nautiyal', 'dranandvardhannautiyal14@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Skin & Hair Disorders (Kitibha)', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.70', 134, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Garhwali\"]', 'Himalayan Vedic Healing Center, Dehradun', 'Dehradun', 'India', 'Dr. Anand Vardhan Nautiyal is a seasoned clinician with nearly two decades of experience in managing chronic skin disorders and hair loss through classical Ayurvedic principles. His diagnostic process focuses on Nadi Pariksha and Doshic imbalance analysis to treat conditions like Kitibha (Psoriasis) and scalp infections from the root. He is renowned for his mastery in Shodhana therapies, particularly Takradhara and Vamana, paired with bespoke herbal protocols for lasting recovery.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Rishikul Government Ayurvedic College, Haridwar\",\"M.D (Kayachikitsa) - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Uttarakhand Ayush Gaurav Samman 2019\",\"Excellence in Clinical Ayurveda 2022\"]', '[\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Panchakarma for Skin Detoxification\",\"Lepa Therapy for Psoriasis\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 2:00 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:00 PM)', 91, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559839734-2b71ea197ec2?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-16', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Vikram Krishnan', 'drvikramkrishnan15@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Mental Wellness & Nootropic Therapies', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Manasa Roga)', 16, '4.80', 112, 800, 800, 700, '[\"English\",\"Tamil\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Hindi\"]', 'Arya Vaidya Pharmacy (AVP) Clinic, Mylapore', 'Chennai', 'India', 'Dr. Vikram Krishnan is a highly regarded Ayurvedic physician with over 16 years of expertise in treating anxiety, sleep disorders, and cognitive decline. He utilizes traditional Nadi Pariksha (pulse diagnosis) along with modern clinical assessments to understand each patient\'s unique mind-body constitution. His customized treatment protocols leverage Medhya Rasayanas (nootropic herbs) combined with Panchakarma therapies like Shirodhara and Nasya to restore mental equilibrium and cognitive vitality.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Sri Dharmasthala Manjunatheshwara College of Ayurveda, Udupi\",\"M.D (Ayurveda) in Manasa Roga - Government Ayurveda Medical College, Bengaluru\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Puraskar for Clinical Excellence 2021\",\"Best Ayur-Psychiatry Specialist Award 2023\"]', '[\"Nootropic Herbology (Medhya Rasayana)\",\"Shirodhara & Psychological Panchakarma\",\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (9:30 AM - 1:30 PM, 4:30 PM - 7:30 PM)', 91, 1920, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-17', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Devendra Prasad Sharma', 'drdevendraprasadsharma16@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Panchakarma Specialist', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Panchakarma)', 18, '4.80', 142, 600, 600, 500, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Rajasthani\"]', 'Shree Radhey Ayurvedic Panchakarma Kendra', 'Jaipur', 'India', 'With over 18 years of clinical practice, Dr. Devendra Prasad Sharma is dedicated to restoring systemic balance through customized Panchakarma therapies. He utilizes traditional Nadi Pariksha (pulse diagnosis) to identify root constitutional imbalances and design personalized detoxification regimens. His clinical expertise lies in successfully managing chronic musculoskeletal disorders, stress-induced ailments, and digestive issues using therapies like Basti, Shirodhara, and classical herbal formulations.', '[\"B.A.M.S - National Institute of Ayurveda, Jaipur\",\"M.D (Panchakarma) - Government Ayurvedic College, Trivandrum\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Award for Excellence in Panchakarma 2018\",\"Best Ayurvedic Clinician (Rajasthan Region) 2022\"]', '[\"Pulse Diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha)\",\"Panchakarma Detoxification (Basti & Shirodhara)\",\"Chronic Pain Management\"]', 'Mon - Sat (9:00 AM - 1:00 PM, 4:00 PM - 8:00 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-18', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Sanjay Deshmukh', 'drsanjaydeshmukh17@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Kayachikitsa (General Medicine)', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.80', 112, 1200, 1200, 1000, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Marathi\"]', 'Dhanvantari Holistic Healing Center', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'Dr. Sanjay Deshmukh is a seasoned Kayachikitsa specialist with nearly two decades of experience in treating chronic metabolic and digestive disorders through classical Ayurvedic protocols. He combines Nadi Pariksha with evidence-based research to design personalized treatment plans involving Deepana, Pachana, and targeted Panchakarma therapies. His clinical focus remains on reversing lifestyle diseases using pure herbal formulations and rigorous lifestyle modifications.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Podar Ayurved Medical College, Mumbai\",\"M.D (Kayachikitsa) - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Sushruta Ratna Award 2019\",\"Best Clinical Practitioner - Maharashtra Council of Indian Medicine 2022\"]', '[\"Pulse Diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha)\",\"Panchakarma Detoxification\",\"Management of Chronic Lifestyle Disorders\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594824813573-246434de83fb?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-19', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Devendra Kumar Mishra', 'drdevendrakumarmishra18@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Shalya Tantra (Ayurvedic Surgery & Marma)', 'BAMS, MS (Ayurveda - Shalya Tantra)', 16, '4.80', 112, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Punjabi\"]', 'Dhanvantari Shalya Chikitsalaya & Marma Care', 'Delhi', 'India', 'With over 16 years of clinical excellence, Dr. Devendra Mishra specializes in Shalya Tantra with a focus on minimally invasive Ayurvedic surgical techniques and Marma Chikitsa. His diagnostic approach integrates traditional Nadi Pariksha with modern radiological assessments to determine the most effective path of healing. He is widely recognized for his high success rates in managing complex ano-rectal disorders using Kshara Sutra and relieving chronic pain through Agnikarma and Raktamokshana.', '[\"B.A.M.S - State Ayurvedic College and Hospital, Lucknow\",\"M.S (Shalya Tantra) - Institute of Medical Sciences, Banaras Hindu University (IMS-BHU), Varanasi\"]', '[\"Sushruta National Award for Excellence in Shalya Tantra 2019\",\"Delhi Dhanvantari Ayur-Vaidya Excellence Award 2023\"]', '[\"Kshara Sutra Therapy (Ano-rectal Specialist)\",\"Marma Chikitsa (Vedic Pain Management)\",\"Para-surgical Procedures (Agnikarma & Raktamokshana)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 1920, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559839734-2b71ea197ec2?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-2', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Aniruddh Deshpande', 'draniruddhdeshpande1@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Kayachikitsa (General Medicine)', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.70', 142, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Marathi\"]', 'Kottakkal Arya Vaidya Sala Agency - Mumbai Branch', 'Mumbai', 'India', 'Dr. Aniruddh Deshpande is a seasoned clinician specializing in internal medicine with over 18 years of experience in managing chronic lifestyle disorders. He integrates classical Nadi Pariksha with modern diagnostic tools to create comprehensive healing protocols for metabolic and respiratory ailments. His practice focuses on root-cause elimination through personalized Panchakarma therapies such as Basti and Shirodhara alongside authentic herbal formulations.', '[\"B.A.M.S - R.A. Podar Ayurved Medical College, Mumbai\",\"M.D (Kayachikitsa) - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Award for Clinical Excellence 2018\",\"Best Ayurveda Consultant of the Year - West India 2022\"]', '[\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Metabolic Disorder Management\",\"Therapeutic Panchakarma\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594824813573-246434de83fb?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-20', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Meera Nair', 'drmeeranair19@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga (Gynaecology)', 'BAMS, MS (Ayurveda - Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga)', 16, '4.80', 112, 500, 500, 400, '[\"English\",\"Malayalam\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\"]', 'Kottakkal Arya Vaidya Sala, Ernakulam Kochi', 'Kochi', 'India', 'With over 16 years of dedicated clinical practice, Dr. Meera Nair is a highly respected specialist in Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga (Ayurvedic Gynaecology and Obstetrics) in Kochi. She employs deep-rooted Ayurvedic diagnostic methods like Nadi Pariksha and Ashtasthana Pariksha to identify root causes of hormonal imbalances and reproductive disorders. Her expertise lies in administering specialized therapies such as Uttara Basti, Yonidhavana, and customized herbal formulations for treating PCOS, infertility, and menopausal issues.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Government Ayurveda College, Tripunithura, Kochi\",\"M.S (Ayurveda) in Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga - Institute of Teaching and Research in Ayurveda (ITRA), Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Kerala State Dhanwantari Award 2022\",\"Excellence in Ayurvedic Gynaecology Research 2024\"]', '[\"Uttara Basti (Intrauterine Therapy)\",\"Infertility & Garbhini Paricharya (Prenatal Care)\",\"PCOS & Menstrual Disorder Management\"]', 'Mon - Sat (9:30 AM - 1:30 PM, 4:30 PM - 7:30 PM)', 92, 1920, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-21', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Raghavendra Bhat', 'drraghavendrabhat20@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Diabetes & Metabolic Disorders', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.80', 124, 600, 600, 500, '[\"English\",\"Kannada\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\"]', 'Kottakkal Arya Vaidya Sala, Indiranagar Clinic', 'Bangalore', 'India', 'With over 18 years of clinical expertise, Dr. Raghavendra Bhat specializes in the holistic management of Type-2 Diabetes (Prameha) and metabolic disorders through evidence-based Ayurveda. He employs precise Nadi Pariksha (pulse diagnosis) to understand constitutional imbalances and designs customized root-cause treatment protocols. His therapies integrate specialized Panchakarma detoxifications like Virechana, tailored dietary regimens, and classical herbal formulations to restore metabolic harmony.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Government Ayurvedic Medical College, Bangalore\",\"M.D (Ayurveda) - Institute of Teaching and Research in Ayurveda (ITRA), Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Sushruta Ayur Award 2018\",\"Karnataka AYUSH Excellence Award 2022\"]', '[\"Pulse Diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha)\",\"Panchakarma Detoxification (Virechana)\",\"Diabetic Neuropathy Management\",\"Dietary & Lifestyle Counseling (Pathya-Apathya)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:00 PM)', 91, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-22', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Ananth Deshpande', 'drananthdeshpande21@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Arthritis & Spine Specialist', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.80', 142, 800, 800, 600, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Marathi\",\"Sanskrit\"]', 'Kerala Ayurveda Vaidyashala, Deccan Gymkhana Branch', 'Pune', 'India', 'With over 18 years of clinical expertise, Dr. Ananth Deshpande specializes in managing chronic musculoskeletal and spinal disorders through traditional Ayurvedic protocols. He utilizes precise Nadi Pariksha (pulse diagnosis) to tailor personalized Shodhana (detoxification) and Shamana (palliative) therapies. His integrative approach combines specialized Panchakarma therapies like Janu Basti and Greeva Basti with targeted herbal formulations to restore joint mobility and spinal health.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Tilak Ayurved Mahavidyalaya, Pune\",\"M.D (Kayachikitsa) - Podar Ayurved Medical College, Mumbai\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Puraskar for Clinical Excellence 2018\",\"Ayurvedic Rheumatology Specialist of the Year 2022\"]', '[\"Spine and Joint Care (Sandhigata Vata)\",\"Panchakarma (Basti & Upanaha)\",\"Pulse Diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 91, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594824813573-246434de83fb?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-23', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Harish Chandra Nautiyal', 'drharishchandranautiyal22@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Skin & Hair Disorders (Kitibha)', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 16, '4.70', 112, 600, 600, 500, '[\"Hindi\",\"English\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Garhwali\"]', 'Devbhoomi Ayurvedic Skin & Panchakarma Kendra', 'Dehradun', 'India', 'With over 16 years of dedicated clinical practice, Dr. Nautiyal specializes in managing chronic skin and hair disorders like Kitibha (Psoriasis) through classical Ayurvedic protocols. His diagnostic approach integrates traditional Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis) with modern clinical evaluation to pinpoint deep-seated dosha imbalances. He designs personalized treatment regimens combining intensive Panchakarma therapies like Raktamokshana and Takradhara alongside customized herbo-mineral formulations.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Rishikul Government Ayurvedic College, Haridwar\",\"M.D (Kayachikitsa) - National Institute of Ayurveda, Jaipur\"]', '[\"Uttarakhand Ayur-Vibhushan Award 2022\",\"Best Ayurvedic Dermatologist - North India Chapter 2024\"]', '[\"Raktamokshana (Bloodletting Therapy)\",\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Takradhara for Psychosomatic Dermatitis\",\"Classical Herbology for Kitibha (Psoriasis)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 2:00 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:00 PM)', 91, 1920, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559839734-2b71ea197ec2?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-24', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Madhavan Krishnan', 'drmadhavankrishnan23@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Mental Wellness & Nootropic Therapies', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Manasa Roga)', 16, '4.80', 112, 800, 800, 700, '[\"English\",\"Tamil\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Malayalam\"]', 'Arya Vaidya Pharmacy (AVP) Clinic, Mylapore', 'Chennai', 'India', 'With over 16 years of clinical excellence, Dr. Madhavan specializes in treating stress, anxiety, and cognitive decline using authentic Ayurvedic methodologies. His diagnostic approach deeply integrates Nadi Pariksha (pulse diagnosis) with modern psychological assessments to understand each patient\'s unique mind-body constitution. He designs highly personalized recovery pathways featuring Shirodhara, Nasya, and proprietary Medhya Rasayana formulations to restore emotional and neurological balance.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Sri Chandrasekharendra Saraswathi Viswa Mahavidyalaya, Kanchipuram\",\"M.D (Ayurveda - Manasa Roga) - Government Ayurveda Medical College, Bengaluru\"]', '[\"Ayur Bhishak Award for Mental Health Advocacy 2022\",\"Excellence in Ayurvedic Nootropic Research 2020\"]', '[\"Mind-Body Type Analysis (Manasika Prakriti)\",\"Shirodhara & Thalapotichil (Head Pack Therapy)\",\"Medhya Rasayana (Nootropic Herbs) Formulations\",\"Ayurvedic Psychotherapy (Satvavajaya Chikitsa)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 91, 1920, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-3', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Ashutosh Bhardwaj', 'drashutoshbhardwaj2@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Shalya Tantra (Ayurvedic Surgery & Marma)', 'BAMS, MS (Ayurveda - Shalya Tantra)', 18, '4.90', 142, 1000, 1000, 800, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Punjabi\"]', 'Dhanwantari Shalya Chikitsalaya & Marma Center', 'Delhi', 'India', 'A seasoned practitioner specializing in para-surgical procedures like Kshara Sutra therapy for anorectal disorders and Marma Chikitsa for musculoskeletal issues. He integrates ancient Shalya Tantra principles with modern diagnostic methods to provide minimally invasive and holistic surgical care. His practice is renowned in Delhi for successfully treating complex cases of fistula-in-ano and chronic sports injuries using traditional Ayurvedic techniques.', '[\"B.A.M.S - All India Institute of Ayurveda (AIIA), New Delhi\",\"M.S (Shalya Tantra) - Banaras Hindu University (BHU), Varanasi\"]', '[\"Sushruta Ratna Award 2019\",\"Excellence in Kshara Sutra Therapy 2022\"]', '[\"Kshara Sutra Therapy (Anorectal Surgery)\",\"Marma Therapy (Vital Point Healing)\",\"Agnikarma (Thermal Cauterization)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 94, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559839734-2b71ea197ec2?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-4', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Lakshmi S. Nair', 'drlakshmisnair3@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga (Gynaecology)', 'BAMS, MS (Ayurveda - Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga)', 18, '4.80', 142, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Malayalam\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\"]', 'Kottakkal Arya Vaidya Sala Agency, Kochi Center', 'Kochi', 'India', 'Dr. Lakshmi Nair is a distinguished specialist with over 18 years of experience in female reproductive health, focusing on root-cause diagnosis through Prakriti analysis. She is renowned for her expertise in managing infertility and hormonal imbalances using specialized Uttara Basti and tailor-made herbal protocols. Her clinical approach integrates traditional Ayurvedic wisdom with personalized lifestyle modifications to ensure long-term wellness for women.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Government Ayurveda College, Thiruvananthapuram\",\"M.S (Prasuti Tantra & Stri Roga) - Amrita School of Ayurveda, Kollam\"]', '[\"Vaidya Ratna Excellence Award 2019\",\"Best Clinical Practitioner in Gynaecology (Ayurveda) 2023\"]', '[\"Infertility Management (Vandhyatwa)\",\"Uttara Basti (Intrauterine Treatment)\",\"PCOS/PCOD Holistic Management\"]', 'Mon - Sat (9:30 AM - 1:30 PM, 4:30 PM - 7:30 PM)', 91, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-5', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Raghavendra Hegde', 'drraghavendrahegde4@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Diabetes & Metabolic Disorders', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.90', 142, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Kannada\"]', 'Indus Valley Ayurvedic Centre, Indiranagar', 'Bangalore', 'India', 'Dr. Raghavendra Hegde specializes in managing Type 2 diabetes and metabolic syndrome through a blend of traditional Nadi Pariksha and evidence-based clinical protocols. His approach integrates customized Panchakarma therapies like Virechana and Takradhara with proprietary herbal formulations to improve insulin sensitivity and metabolic health. He focuses on long-term lifestyle modification and root-cause reversal of metabolic imbalances to ensure sustainable patient wellness.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Government Ayurvedic Medical College, Bangalore\",\"M.D (Kayachikitsa) - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Award for Metabolic Research 2019\",\"Best Ayurvedic Practitioner - Karnataka State 2022\"]', '[\"Pulse Diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha)\",\"Metabolic Correction via Panchakarma\",\"Prameha Chikitsa (Diabetes Management)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-6', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Vinay Deshpande', 'drvinaydeshpande5@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Arthritis & Spine Specialist', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.70', 142, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Marathi\",\"Sanskrit\"]', 'Sanjeevani Ayurvedic Spine & Joint Clinic', 'Pune', 'India', 'Dr. Vinay Deshpande is a dedicated specialist with over 18 years of clinical expertise in treating complex spinal conditions and chronic arthritic disorders. He utilizes a precision-based approach combining Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis) with specialized Shodhana and Shamana therapies to restore joint mobility and alleviate pain. His clinical practice is renowned for successful non-surgical interventions using Kati Basti, Greva Basti, and customized herbal decoctions.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Tilak Ayurved Mahavidyalaya, Pune\",\"M.D (Kayachikitsa) - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Ayurveda Ratna Award 2018\",\"Clinical Excellence in Spine Care 2023\"]', '[\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Kati Basti & Janu Basti\",\"Marma Chikitsa\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594824813573-246434de83fb?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-7', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Arvind Nautiyal', 'drarvindnautiyal6@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Skin & Hair Disorders (Kitibha)', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Kayachikitsa)', 18, '4.70', 134, 600, 600, 500, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Garhwali\"]', 'Shivalik Ayurvedic Skin & Wellness Center', 'Dehradun', 'India', 'Dr. Nautiyal has over 18 years of clinical experience in treating chronic skin conditions like Psoriasis (Kitibha) and Eczema through traditional Ayurvedic principles. He utilizes Nadi Pariksha to identify underlying Dosha imbalances and focuses on Rakta Shodhana (blood purification) through customized Panchakarma therapies. His treatment plans integrate Shodhana (detox) and Shamana (palliative herbs) along with strict dietary guidelines for long-term skin health.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Rishikul Government Ayurvedic College, Haridwar\",\"M.D - National Institute of Ayurveda, Jaipur\"]', '[\"Uttarakhand Ratan for Medical Service 2019\",\"Charaka Excellence Award in Skin Care 2022\"]', '[\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Virechana Karma (Purgation Therapy)\",\"Herbal Dermato-Therapy\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 2:00 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:00 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559839734-2b71ea197ec2?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-8', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. K. Ananthakrishnan', 'drkananthakrishnan7@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Mental Wellness & Nootropic Therapies', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Manasa Roga)', 18, '4.90', 142, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Tamil\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\"]', 'Sree Shankara Ayurveda Nilayam', 'Chennai', 'India', 'Dr. Ananthakrishnan is a distinguished specialist in Manasa Roga with nearly two decades of clinical experience in treating cognitive decline and anxiety disorders. His diagnostic approach integrates classical Nadi Pariksha with modern psychological assessments to create personalized Medhya Rasayana (nootropic) protocols. He specializes in therapeutic interventions such as Shirodhara, Nasya, and customized herbal formulations to enhance mental clarity and emotional balance.', '[\"B.A.M.S - Government Ayurveda College, Thiruvananthapuram\",\"M.D (Manasa Roga) - National Institute of Ayurveda, Jaipur\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Puraskar for Mental Health 2019\",\"Global Ayurveda Excellence Award 2023\"]', '[\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Medhya Rasayana (Nootropic Therapy)\",\"Manasa Roga (Psychiatric Ayurveda)\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=400&q=80', NULL),
  ('doc-dir-9', NULL, 'local', 'Dr. Aditya Pratap Singh', 'dradityapratapsingh8@ayurvedaconnect.com', 'password', 'Panchakarma Specialist', 'BAMS, MD (Ayurveda - Panchakarma)', 18, '4.70', 142, 800, 800, 650, '[\"English\",\"Hindi\",\"Sanskrit\",\"Rajasthani\"]', 'Dhanwantari Ayurveda & Panchakarma Center', 'Jaipur', 'India', 'Dr. Singh is a seasoned practitioner with over 18 years of clinical expertise in classical Panchakarma therapies and metabolic rejuvenation. He employs precise Nadi Pariksha for root-cause diagnosis, specializing in Vamana and Virechana procedures to treat chronic lifestyle disorders. His approach integrates authentic Shirodhara and Basti treatments with personalized herbal protocols for holistic wellness.', '[\"B.A.M.S - National Institute of Ayurveda (NIA), Jaipur\",\"M.D (Panchakarma) - Gujarat Ayurved University, Jamnagar\"]', '[\"Dhanwantari Puraskar 2019\",\"Excellence in Panchakarma Therapy Award 2022\"]', '[\"Nadi Pariksha (Pulse Diagnosis)\",\"Panchakarma Detoxification\",\"Chronic Pain Management via Basti Therapy\"]', 'Mon - Sat (10:00 AM - 1:30 PM, 5:00 PM - 8:30 PM)', 92, 2160, 1, 1, 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?w=400&q=80', NULL);

