  ('symp-symptom_checker_faqs', 'SYMPTOM_CHECKER_FAQS', '[{\"id\":\"f1\",\"answer\":\"No. This tool provides educational Ayurvedic guidance based on ancient wisdom. It is not a medical diagnosis tool. Always consult a qualified Ayurvedic physician or healthcare professional for proper diagnosis and treatment.\",\"category\":\"General\",\"question\":\"Is this AI Symptom Checker a replacement for a doctor?\"},{\"id\":\"f2\",\"answer\":\"Our assessment is based on classical Ayurvedic texts (Charaka Samhita, Ashtanga Hridayam) and covers physical, mental and behavioral patterns. It gives you a strong starting point, but a personalized consultation with an Ayurvedic Vaidya provides a much deeper analysis of your Prakriti.\",\"category\":\"Dosha\",\"question\":\"How accurate is the Dosha assessment?\"},{\"id\":\"f3\",\"answer\":\"The full 8-step assessment typically takes 5–8 minutes. Each question is designed to capture meaningful health data. You can pause and resume anytime.\",\"category\":\"Assessment\",\"question\":\"How long does the assessment take?\"},{\"id\":\"f4\",\"answer\":\"Absolutely. All information you enter is processed locally and never shared with third parties. We follow strict privacy guidelines to protect your health information.\",\"category\":\"Privacy\",\"question\":\"Is my health data private and secure?\"},{\"id\":\"f5\",\"answer\":\"If you are experiencing severe, sudden or life-threatening symptoms (chest pain, difficulty breathing, severe bleeding, loss of consciousness), please call emergency services immediately. This tool is for non-emergency wellness guidance only.\",\"category\":\"Safety\",\"question\":\"What do I do if my symptoms are severe?\"},{\"id\":\"f6\",\"answer\":\"This tool is designed for adults aged 18+. For children, elderly or pregnant/nursing individuals, we strongly recommend consulting a qualified Ayurvedic physician directly for age-appropriate and safe guidance.\",\"category\":\"Safety\",\"question\":\"Can I use this for children or during pregnancy?\"},{\"id\":\"f7\",\"answer\":\"We recommend reassessing every 4–6 weeks as you implement lifestyle and dietary changes. Ayurvedic healing is gradual; regular reassessment helps track your progress and adjust recommendations accordingly.\",\"category\":\"Assessment\",\"question\":\"How often should I reassess my symptoms?\"},{\"id\":\"f8\",\"answer\":\"The three Doshas are Vata (air + space), Pitta (fire + water) and Kapha (earth + water). Every person has a unique combination called Prakriti (constitution). When doshas become imbalanced (Vikruti), disease occurs. Ayurveda aims to restore the natural Prakriti balance.\",\"category\":\"Dosha\",\"question\":\"What are the 3 Doshas in Ayurveda?\"}]', '2026-10-02 13:17:28'),
  ('symp-symptom_checker_testimonials', 'SYMPTOM_CHECKER_TESTIMONIALS', '[{\"id\":\"t1\",\"age\":34,\"name\":\"Priya Sharma\",\"avatar\":\"👩\",\"rating\":5,\"result\":\"The assessment identified my anxiety and insomnia as Vata issues. After following the protocol for 6 weeks, my sleep improved dramatically!\",\"location\":\"Mumbai\",\"condition\":\"Vata Imbalance\"},{\"id\":\"t2\",\"age\":45,\"name\":\"Rajesh Menon\",\"avatar\":\"👨\",\"rating\":5,\"result\":\"Had chronic acid reflux for years. The tool pinpointed Pitta as the cause and the cooling diet changes resolved it in 3 weeks!\",\"location\":\"Bangalore\",\"condition\":\"Pitta Excess\"},{\"id\":\"t3\",\"age\":28,\"name\":\"Anita Gupta\",\"avatar\":\"👩‍🦱\",\"rating\":5,\"result\":\"Struggled with weight and fatigue. Kapha-pacifying routine gave me energy I haven\'t felt in years! Game changer!\",\"location\":\"Delhi\",\"condition\":\"Kapha Accumulation\"},{\"id\":\"t4\",\"age\":52,\"name\":\"Suresh Patel\",\"avatar\":\"👴\",\"rating\":5,\"result\":\"The detailed dosha analysis was eye-opening. Now I understand why certain seasons worsen my symptoms. Excellent tool!\",\"location\":\"Ahmedabad\",\"condition\":\"Mixed Dosha\"}]', '2026-10-02 13:17:28');

